  "display_title": "My Stowaway Diary",
  "description": "A stowaway named Lee Sesang wakes up in the middle of the ocean, aboard a cargo ship. It has already been a month since he started living there, treated like a nuisance by the crew. Branded as an unwanted intruder, he barely speaks to anyone, except for Aeri, the ship’s cook. Aeri is the only one who doesn’t outright shun him, and so, Sesang begins helping out in the kitchen, trying to pull his weight. One day, as they find themselves alone in the kitchen, Aeri suddenly smirks and says:\n\n*\"Do you even know how heavy they are? Wanna try lifting it?\"*\n\nSoft and squishy. A naughty little prank begins in the quiet kitchen..\n\n*\"Sesang, are you… really gonna touch them?”*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
